            },
            {
                "entry_id": "e7f11b81-72dc-3aa0-b4f0-c04b219133dc",
                "word": "platiste",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "dbf92e3f-bdc7-4f94-a810-58fe1cbd9570",
                        "entry_id": "e7f11b81-72dc-3aa0-b4f0-c04b219133dc",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "platistes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8d2ea5fa-1129-3509-a6be-955f16a5f536",
                        "entry_id": "e7f11b81-72dc-3aa0-b4f0-c04b219133dc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Dans le jargon des rôlistes, personne jouant majoritairement à des jeux de société (aussi appelés jeux de plateau)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "neologism"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b654ea07-11e2-4820-a490-e8b3044e031b",
                                "sense_id": "8d2ea5fa-1129-3509-a6be-955f16a5f536",
                                "text": "ö ami platiste, si tu es aussi lecteur de SF et de Fantasy, ce qui suit va probablement te réjouir (sinon, tu peux zapper). Vous vous peut être entendu parler du Dernier Anneau, le roman de Kirill Eskov qui faisait une relecture du Seigneur des anneaux vu par les orcs ? Note : « probablemetnt » a été corrigé en probablement."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "37e1c513-676a-4268-b142-031a03eef76b",
                                "sense_id": "8d2ea5fa-1129-3509-a6be-955f16a5f536",
                                "text": "Oui enfin je pense qu'un platiste bruyant de Lyon JDR que l'on connait sera plus receptif a des demandes d'un peu plus de discretion qu'un platiste que l'on ne connait pas ;)"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "df248849-be7f-43b2-884d-2ba1b19b7c05",
                        "source_entry_id": "e7f11b81-72dc-3aa0-b4f0-c04b219133dc",
                        "source_sense_id": "8d2ea5fa-1129-3509-a6be-955f16a5f536",
                        "target_lang_word": "boardgamer",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "boardgamer",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d26fac2b-69bf-3e3c-947b-3670b66ad3e9",
                                        "entry_id": "7a87d1a8-b31d-3409-9249-a5db32ef124d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alternative form of board gamer."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "alternative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c5d97aa7-b13f-4464-a853-f738c38ecad0",
                                                "sense_id": "d26fac2b-69bf-3e3c-947b-3670b66ad3e9",
                                                "text": "Again, we don’t want to exclude anyone, but we’re pretty sure the RPG crowd would be uncomfortable being around boardgamers trying to get them in boardgames every session."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9e80c67c-99f5-48b6-90f9-bb41d7d1c895",
                                                "sense_id": "d26fac2b-69bf-3e3c-947b-3670b66ad3e9",
                                                "text": "Did a growth in leisure time contribute to Marie’s obsession with Star Trek? To the boardgamers’ immersion in a World at War?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bb946190-fa1e-47d4-8ad4-d3e76775993d",
                                                "sense_id": "d26fac2b-69bf-3e3c-947b-3670b66ad3e9",
                                                "text": "Randall argues too that the nature of rules is quite different in video games and boardgames, much more clearly regimented and maintained by the video game itself in the former, while in the latter, boardgamers play a much more participatory role in developing, agreeing and maintaining game rules during play."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "word_linkages": [
                    {
                        "linkage_id": "181619fa-aba3-476f-b0dc-c161c483fcb0",
                        "source_entry_id": "e7f11b81-72dc-3aa0-b4f0-c04b219133dc",
                        "source_sense_ids": [
                            "8d2ea5fa-1129-3509-a6be-955f16a5f536"
