            },
            {
                "entry_id": "3a824231-5c11-31d2-a836-54c7791b92e3",
                "word": "platiste",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "0a7bddc1-f467-4244-813a-9ea33f7dd7dd",
                        "entry_id": "3a824231-5c11-31d2-a836-54c7791b92e3",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "platistes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "470186ec-28a6-3f1f-977b-023712b738af",
                        "entry_id": "3a824231-5c11-31d2-a836-54c7791b92e3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Personne croyant à la théorie de la Terre plate."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "neologism"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ab7d8eeb-57f6-4eb5-a0dc-558a7a58bb8e",
                                "sense_id": "470186ec-28a6-3f1f-977b-023712b738af",
                                "text": "Prouver que la Terre est plate alors que se déroule une course autour du globe n’est pas une mince affaire pour les « platistes »… Selon les partisans de la terre plate, les satellites n’existent pas, ce sont des câbles sous marins ou des ballons, et donc la localisation par GPS ne se fait pas non plus par satellite…"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "58fa1d85-4a8e-4059-9762-30240cb58939",
                                "sense_id": "470186ec-28a6-3f1f-977b-023712b738af",
                                "text": "Il est difficile de savoir combien les platistes sont réellement. Il y a 10 000 personnes inscrites sur le forum Flat Earth Society. Mais il faut compter les trolls et les antis."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "98d601a8-96e9-4fa6-b994-54328b4721fa",
                                "sense_id": "470186ec-28a6-3f1f-977b-023712b738af",
                                "text": "Des propositions de contenu qui sont maintenant échafaudées pour maximiser le recouvrement avec ce qui est déjà cru. C’est comme ça, comme vous le savez, que marche l’algorithme de Youtube. Autrement dit, on va proposer des vidéos disant que la Terre est plate aux platistes. Est-ce que c’est une bonne nouvelle ?"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bab19b07-1f9c-4654-8a52-c26388125cd3",
                        "source_entry_id": "3a824231-5c11-31d2-a836-54c7791b92e3",
                        "source_sense_id": "470186ec-28a6-3f1f-977b-023712b738af",
                        "target_lang_word": "flat-earther",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "flat-earther",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ac419b65-65b4-368e-ac98-a3ac63cf5afa",
                                        "entry_id": "716140d4-68ed-3417-9609-0f343d4324a6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who believes or advocates the claim that the planet Earth is flat."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6452c3af-2a1a-455a-bbe7-81ccfa18807f",
                                                "sense_id": "ac419b65-65b4-368e-ac98-a3ac63cf5afa",
                                                "text": "His commitment to remaining a flat-earther seems to be strengthened by counterarguments rather than weakened by them."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8b265c52-2156-3341-920f-6535f7493394",
                                        "entry_id": "716140d4-68ed-3417-9609-0f343d4324a6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who believes or advocates an outlandish, discredited theory; a person who refuses to acknowledge the truth despite overwhelming evidence."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly",
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a313ffef-3de7-4244-8f8c-01fcf793a278",
                                                "sense_id": "8b265c52-2156-3341-920f-6535f7493394",
                                                "text": "2008, Bob Sweere, \"Voice of the Day: Global warming? Yes,\" News-Leader.com (Missouri), 16 Jun. (retrieved 1 July 2008),\nGlobal warming is settled, unless you are a flat earther or an energy company apologist."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "35dc188b-7c78-4613-808b-9415ce96b596",
                                                "sense_id": "8b265c52-2156-3341-920f-6535f7493394",
                                                "text": "When it comes to vaccine safety, they are diehard flat-earthers: the microchips and mercury are articles of faith."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "84323e0a-17d4-4d28-8fe7-cdb0aeabd1b5",
                        "source_entry_id": "3a824231-5c11-31d2-a836-54c7791b92e3",
